aseError\\\", e.getMessage());\\n            return RC_DB_ERROR;\\n        }\\n        return RC_SUCCESS;\\n    }\\n}\\n\", \"content_hash\": \"3236d23fe5afcbd68284a7bb29a470e440668d66fcea8e8e62b69c4035259fc2\"}], \"consumers\": [\"INTERNET/GetClientLinksOp\"], \"external_dependencies\": [], \"referenced_definitions\": [], \"fingerprint\": \"42b95631a1866d97e7e0cbfa519a8a98ab916115e1acd3954c310377bb3ab4ae\", \"schema_version\": \"v1\", \"requirements\": {\"business\": \"Preserve this complete configured unit's evidenced behavior\"}, \"evidence_ids\": [\"configured_step-42b95631a1866d97e7e0cbfa\", \"com.ibm.dse.base.CCOperationStep\", \"com.ibm.dse.base.Context\", \"com.ibm.il.dse.operations.internet.db.GetClientLinksSP\"], \"converted_dependency_apis\": [{\"unit_id\": \"request_unformat-561a01497abb3d3133b663f0\", \"planned_apis\": [{\"type_name\": \"com.company.generated.units.u561a01497abb.GetClientLinksRequestUnformatMapper\", \"method_signatures\": [\"public com.company.generated.units.u561a01497abb.GetClientLinksRequest toBusinessInput(com.company.generated.units.u561a01497abb.GetClientLinksRequestXml)\", \"public com.company.generated.units.u561a01497abb.GetClientLinksRequest unformat(java.lang.String)\"]}], \"verified_api_surface\": {\"src/main/java/com/company/generated/units/u561a01497abb/GetClientLinksRequest.java\": {\"imports\": [], \"public_declarations\": [\"public class GetClientLinksRequest\", \"public GetClientLinksRequest()\", \"public GetClientLinksRequest(String clientId, String bankId)\", \"public String getClientId()\", \"public void setClientId(String clientId)\", \"public String getBankId()\", \"public void setBankId(String bankId)\"]}, \"src/main/java/com/company/generated/units/u561a01497abb/GetClientLinksRequestXml.java\": {\"imports\": [\"import com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat.xml.annotation.JacksonXmlProperty;\", \"import com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat.xml.annotation.JacksonXmlRootElement;\"], \"public_declarations\": [\"public class 