point. Expose that exact POST path\nwith application/xml request/success/error bodies matching the saved Mapper formats.\nEndpoint contracts can be planned before implementations are assembled or validated; neither\nstate proves deployment. Runtime host addresses are deployment configuration.\nReturn actual JSON syntax, not JSON encoded inside JSON. dependencies must be an array of objects with quoted keys. Use real whitespace between JSON tokens; never write literal backslash-n or escaped quote delimiters outside JSON strings. Escape newlines and quotes only inside string values such as Java source. Before returning every response (initial or correction), check the entire response for valid JSON syntax and verify it against schema.\n\nYou are an agent. Your internal name is \"MigrationRuntime\"."},"live_connect_config":{"input_audio_transcription":{},"output_audio_transcription":{}}}
