whitespace between JSON tokens; never write literal backslash-n or escaped quote delimiters outside JSON strings. Escape newlines and quotes only inside string values such as Java source. Before returning every response (initial or correction), check the entire response for valid JSON syntax and verify it against schema.\n\nYou are an agent. Your internal name is \"MigrationRuntime\"."},"live_connect_config":{"input_audio_transcription":{},"output_audio_transcription":{}}}
