ategory, String errorNumber, String errorDescription, String requestId)\", \"public String format(ErrorReply reply) throws Exception\", \"public ErrorReply unformat(String xml) throws Exception\"]}}, \"contract\": {\"unit_id\": \"response_format-66bf2c108225fb63eb2a0cbe\", \"apis\": [{\"type_name\": \"com.company.generated.units.u66bf2c108225.StandardErrorRSFmtMapper\", \"method_signatures\": [\"public java.lang.String format(com.company.generated.units.u66bf2c108225.StandardErrorRSFmtMapper$ErrorReply)\", \"public com.company.generated.units.u66bf2c108225.StandardErrorRSFmtMapper$ErrorReply unformat(java.lang.String)\"]}], \"dependency_units\": [], \"requirements\": {\"business\": \"Preserve this complete configured unit's evidenced behavior\"}, \"evidence_ids\": [\"response_format-66bf2c108225fb63eb2a0cbe\", \"com.ibm.dse.base.Context\", \"com.ibm.dse.base.Tag\", \"com.ibm.il.dse.cc.decorator.NilDecorator\", \"com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCString\", \"com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCXML\"]}, \"input_type\": null, \"output_type\": \"com.company.generated.units.u66bf2c108225.StandardErrorRSFmtMapper$ErrorReply\", \"wire_type\": \"com.company.generated.units.u66bf2c108225.StandardErrorRSFmtMapper$ErrorReplyWire\", \"source_ids\": [\"com.ibm.dse.base.Context\", \"com.ibm.dse.base.Tag\", \"com.ibm.il.dse.cc.decorator.NilDecorator\", \"com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCString\", \"com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCXML\"]}}, \"operation_sources\": [{\"identity\": \"com.ibm.il.dse.cc.cut.CCDSEServerOperation\", \"content_hash\": \"fcaf68594b17326659d327bcc975553a231d2d1e62f7b741959b9e142603d288\", \"content\": \"package com.ibm.il.dse.cc.cut;\\n\\nimport com.ibm.dse.base.Context;\\nimport com.ibm.dse.base.DSEServerOperation;\\nimport com.ibm.dse.base.KeyedCollection;\\nimport com.ibm.dse.base.Tag;\\n\\nimport java.util.Hashtable;\\n\\n/**\\n * Base class for all WSBCC operations.\\n * Loaded from XML via initializeFrom(Tag). Channel handler calls:\\n *   1. unformat(requestXml)\\n *   2. execute()\\n *   3. format() -> returns response XML\\n *\\n * DO NOT instantiate directly. Defined as 'compound' in dse.ini operations section.\\n */\\npublic class CCDSEServerOperation extends DSEServerOperation {\\n\\n    private static final int RC_TIMEOUT = -99;\\n\\n    private String  operationName;\\n    private String  hostKey;\\n    private String  operationFields;\\n    private boolean writeToLog       = false;\\n    private boolean writeToOfecStat  = false;\\n    private boolean isSelectiveJournalising = false;\\n\\n    private boolean returnedErrorBodyChanged = false;\\n    private String  returnedErrorBodyChanger = null;\\n\\n    private Hashtable formats  = new Hashtable();\\n\\n    /**\\n     * Main execution loop. Called by channel handler after unformat().\\n     * Runs the opStep chain according to RC routing attributes.\\n     */\\n    @Override\\n    public void execute() throws Exception {\\n        // Pre-populate context with operationFields (key=value pairs)\\n        if (operationFields != null && !operationFields.isBlank()) {\\n            setFields(operationFields);\\n        }\\n\\n        // Remove opSteps that are not applicable to this channel (onlyFor filtering)\\n        removeOpStepsNotForThisChannel();\\n\\n        // Run the opStep chain\\n        int index = 0;\\n        do {\\n            KeyedCollection kc = getOperationStep(index);\\n            index = processOpStep(kc, operationName, index);\\n        } while (index != -1);\\n\\n        // Substitute error reply format if on{N}Return was triggered\\n        if (isReturnedErrorBodyChanged() && getReturnedErrorBodyChanger() != null) {\\n            // The channel handler reads csErrorReplyFormat instead of csReplyFormat\\n            substituteErrorReplyFormat();\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    /**\\n     * Routes from one opStep to the next based on the return code.\\n     * Priority order:\\n     *   1. on{N}Return  -- switch error reply format body before routing\\n     *   2. onTimeoutDo  -- if RC == RC_TIMEOUT\\n     *   3. on{N}Do      -- exact RC match\\n     *   4. onOtherDo    -- default when no on{N}Do matches\\n     *   5. onOtherDoDefault -- final fallback (logs warning)\\n     */\\n    private int processOpStep(KeyedCollection kc, String opName, int currentIndex) {\\n        // Implementation provided by WAS runtime\\n        throw new UnsupportedOperationException(\\\"Runtime method\\\");\\n    }\\n\\n    private void removeOpStepsNotForThisChannel() {\\n        // Reads onlyFor attribute on each opStep; removes non-matching steps\\n        throw new UnsupportedOperationException(\\\"Runtime method\\\");\\n    }\\n\\n    private void setFields(String operationFields) {\\n        // Parses \\\"KEY=VALUE,KEY2=VALUE2\\\" and sets each in context\\n        throw new UnsupportedOperationException(\\\"Runtime method\\\");\\n    }\\n\\n    private void substituteErrorReplyFormat() {\\n        throw new UnsupportedOperationException(\\\"Runtime method\\\");\\n    }\\n\\n    public boolean isReturnedErrorBodyChanged()  { return returnedErrorBodyChanged; }\\n    public String  getReturnedErrorBodyChanger() { return returnedErrorBodyChanger; }\\n    public Hashtable getFormats()                { return formats; }\\n    public String getHostKey()                   { return hostKey; }\\n    public void setHostKey(String v)             { this.hostKey = v; }\\n    public String getOperationFields()           { return operationFields; }\\n    public void setOperationFields(String v)     { this.operationFields = v; }\\n    public boolean isWriteToLog()                { return writeToLog; }\\n    public void setWriteToLog(boolean v)         { this.writeToLog = v; }\\n}\\n\"}], \"requirements\": {\"route-ValidateClientLinksFetch\": \"{'on0Do': 'end', 'onOtherDo': 'end'}\", \"operation-flow\": \"Preserve the configured operation order, outcome/error branches and initialization\", \"operation-step-injection\": \"Receive all configured operation-step objects through the service constructor; never construct them inside the service. Preserve role bindings and configure required external resources.\", \"native-operation-calls\": \"Replace Composer dispatch with saved native HTTP contracts; test request/reply mapping, business errors, transport failures and timeouts\"}, \"java_version\": 25, \"operation_calls\": [{\"callee\": \"INTERNET/GetClientLinksOp\", \"caller\": \"INTERNET/ValidateClientLinksOp\", \"evidence_hash\": \"9fa02bfacf511806fb9cb54cf4349959174eff97a45909101bfae20af276cc1d\", \"note\": \"opsteps\\\\ValidateClientLinksFetch.md\", \"parameters\": {\"opExecuteName\": \"GetClientLinksOp\"}, \"step\": \"ValidateClientLinksFetch\", \"transitions\": {\"on0Do\": \"end\", \"onOtherDo\": \"end\"}, \"service_contract\": {\"base_url_property\": \"operations.4f5f5fbdd1e3.base-url\", \"call_evidence\": [], \"error_policy\": \"Preserve target error XML and map evidenced return outcomes; report unknown mappings.\", \"formats\": {\"csErrorReplyFormat\": {\"markdown\": \"# StandardErrorRSFmt\\n\\n---\\nentity_type: format\\nentity_id: StandardErrorRSFmt\\nconversion_status: not_started\\nshared: true\\nused_by_operations:\\n  - GetAccountDetailsOp\\n  - GetClientAccountsOp\\n  - GetClientLinksOp\\n  - GetClientOverviewOp\\n  - TransferFundsOp\\n  - ValidateClientLinksOp\\nsource_file: C:\\\\GitHub\\\\shaybc\\\\snapir\\\\bank-demo\\\\composer\\\\Workspace\\\\WSBCC_XML\\\\src\\\\Xml Definition\\\\Channel\\\\XML\\\\defaultFile\\\\dseformat.xml\\nsource_hash: c1896648708bc8b2fcef4dfea7b956580922d56268c6a6947c807ccec9063f52\\n---\\n\\n## Structure\\n```xml\\n<CCXML dataName=\\\"ErrorReply\\\">\\n  <CCString dataName=\\\"ErrorCategory\\\"/>\\n  <CCString dataName=\\\"ErrorNumber\\\"/>\\n  <CCString dataName=\\\"ErrorDescription\\\">\\n  </CCString>\\n    decorator: <nilDecorator/>\\n  <CCString dataName=\\\"RequestId\\\"/>\\n</CCXML>\\n```\\n\\n\\n## Referenced Tags\\n- [CCXML](formats/CCXML.md)\\n- [CCString](formats/CCString.md)\\n- [nilDecorator](formats/nilDecorator.md)\\n\\n## Mapped Java Classes\\n- [com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCXML](classes/com/ibm/il/dse/cc/format/CCXML.md)\\n- [com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCString](classes/com/ibm/il/dse/cc/format/CCString.md)\\n- [com.ibm.il.dse.cc.decorator.NilDecorator](classes/com/ibm/il/dse/cc/decorator/NilDecorator.md)\\n\\n## Inferred External Dependencies\\n- None\\n\", \"name\": \"StandardErrorRSFmt\"}, \"csReplyFormat\": {\"markdown\": \"# GetClientLinksRSFmt\\n\\n---\\nentity_type: format\\nentity_id: GetClientLinksRSFmt\\nconversion_status: not_started\\nshared: true\\nused_by_operations:\\n  - GetClientLinksOp\\n  - GetClientOverviewOp\\n  - ValidateClientLinksOp\\nsource_file: C:\\\\GitHub\\\\shaybc\\\\snapir\\\\bank-demo\\\\composer\\\\Workspace\\\\WSBCC_INTERNET\\\\src\\\\Xml Definition\\\\Channel\\\\INTERNET\\\\selfDefOper\\\\GetClientLinks.xml\\nsource_hash: 5e8b0678d1d4e8c4d53ee6e1e39a933baff92bdd194e0ec8b9634c6d93faac88\\n---\\n\\n## Structure\\n```xml\\n<CCXML dataName=\\\"GetClientLinksResponse\\\" transparent=\\\"true\\\">\\n  <CCString dataName=\\\"ClientId\\\"/>\\n  <CCIColl dataName=\\\"Links\\\" times=\\\"*\\\">\\n    <CCXML dataName=\\\"Link\\\">\\n      <CCString dataName=\\\"LinkId\\\">\\n      </CCString>\\n        decorator: <CCMandatory/>\\n      <CCTableFormat dataName=\\\"LinkDescription\\\" fromColumn=\\\"DESCRIPTION\\\" fromTable=\\\"LINK_TYPES\\\" keyValue=\\\"LinkId\\\">\\n      </CCTableFormat>\\n        decorator: <nilDecorator/>\\n      <CCString dataName=\\\"LinkUrl\\\"/>\\n      <CCBoolean dataName=\\\"IsExternal\\\"/>\\n      <CCString dataName=\\\"IconCode\\\">\\n      </CCString>\\n        decorator: <nilDecorator/>\\n    </CCXML>\\n  </CCIColl>\\n</CCXML>\\n```\\n\\n## Serialization Notes\\n- This format contains CCXML serialization flags that affect the XML wire shape.\\n- `GetClientLinksResponse transparent=true`\\n\\n## Database Lookups\\n> These lookups were encoded inside the WSBCC format definition. In the converted service they must be moved to the service layer, not the serializer.\\n\\n- CCTableFormat: fromTable `LINK_TYPES`, fromColumn `DESCRIPTION`, keyValue `LinkId`\\n\\n\\n## Referenced Tags\\n- [CCXML](formats/CCXML.md)\\n- [CCString](formats/CCString.md)\\n- [CCIColl](formats/CCIColl.md)\\n- [CCMandatory](formats/CCMandatory.md)\\n- [CCTableFormat](formats/CCTableFormat.md)\\n- [nilDecorator](formats/nilDecorator.md)\\n- [CCBoolean](formats/CCBoolean.md)\\n\\n## Mapped Java Classes\\n- [com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCXML](classes/com/ibm/il/dse/cc/format/CCXML.md)\\n- [com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCString](classes/com/ibm/il/dse/cc/format/CCString.md)\\n- [com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCIColl](classes/com/ibm/il/dse/cc/format/CCIColl.md)\\n- com.ibm.il.dse.cc.decorator.CCMandatory\\n- [com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCTableFormat](classes/com/ibm/il/dse/cc/format/CCTableFormat.md)\\n- [com.ibm.il.dse.cc.decorator.NilDecorator](classes/com/ibm/il/dse/cc/decorator/NilDecorator.md)\\n- [com.ibm.il.dse.cc.format.CCBoolean](classes/com/ibm/il/dse/cc/format/CCBoolean.md)\\n\\n## Inferred External Dependencies\\n- Database\\n- API/Service\\n\", \"name\": \"GetClientLinksRSFmt\"}, \"csRequestFormat\": {\"markdown\": \"# GetClientLinksRQFmt\\n\\n---\\nentity_type: format\\nentity_id: GetClientLinksRQFmt\\nconversion_status: not_started\\nshared: true\\nused_by_operations:\\n  - GetClientLinksOp\\n  - GetClientOverviewOp\\n  - ValidateClientLinksOp\\nsource_file: C:\\\\GitHub\\\\shaybc\\\\snapir\\\\bank-demo\\\\composer\\\\Workspace\\\\WSBCC_INTERNET\\\\src\\\\Xml Definition\\\\Channel\\\\INTERNET\\\\selfDefOper\\\\GetClientLinks.xml\\nsource_hash: 5e8b0678d1d4e8c4d53ee6e1e39a933baff92bdd194e0ec8b9634c6d93faac88\\n---\\n\\n## Structure\\n```xml\\n<CCXML dataName=\\\"GetClientLinks\\\">\\n  <CCString dataName=\\\"ClientId\\\">\\n  </CCString>\\n    decorator: <CCMandatory/>\\n  <CCString dataName=\\\"BankId\\\">\\n  </CCString>\\n    decorator: <CCPadding length=\\\"4\\\" pad