esult = step.execute(\"456\", \"002\");\n        assertEquals(0, result);\n\n        verify(httpClient).send(any(HttpRequest.class), any(HttpResponse.BodyHandler.class));\n    }\n}"}], "dependencies": [{"group_id": "org.junit.jupiter", "artifact_id": "junit-jupiter", "version": "5.10.0", "scope": "test", "reason": "JUnit Jupiter tests and execution engine", "required_classes": ["org.junit.jupiter.api.Test", "org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions", "org.junit.jupiter.api.BeforeEach"]}, {"group_id": "org.mockito", "artifact_id": "mockito-core", "version": "5.23.0", "scope": "test", "reason": "Mockito mocking framework", "required_classes": ["org.mockito.Mockito", "org.mockito.ArgumentMatchers"]}], "coverage": {"business": ["src/test/java/com/company/generated/units/u15edb87ae7f6/ValidateClientLinksFetchStepBusinessTest.java", "src/test/java/com/company/generated/units/u15edb87ae7f6/ValidateClientLinksFetchStepAdapterTest.java", "src/test/java/com/company/generated/units/u15edb87ae7f6/ValidateClientLinksFetchOperationCallTest.java"], "native-operation-calls": ["src/test/java/com/company/generated/units/u15edb87ae7f6/ValidateClientLinksFetchOperationCallTest.java"]}, "evidence_ids": ["configured_step-15edb87ae7f68ca9aed10a8b", "com.ibm.dse.base.CCOperationStep", "com.ibm.dse.base.Context", "com.ibm.il.dse.cc.cut.CCComplexOpStep"], "unresolved_questions": [], "unit_contract": {"unit_id": "configured_step-15edb87ae7f68ca9aed10a8b", "apis": [{"type_name": "com.company.generated.units.u15edb87ae7f6.ValidateClientLinksFetchStep", "method_signatures": ["public int execute(java.lang.String, java.lang.String) throws java.lang.Exception"]}], "dependency_units": ["request_unformat-561a01497abb3d3133b663f0", "response_format-66bf2c108225fb63eb2a0cbe", "response_format-5dfecf09ff9fd30503abf76e"], "requirements": {"business": "Preserve this complete configured unit's evidenced behavior", "native-operation-calls": "Replace Composer dispatch with saved native HTTP contracts; test request/r