n                .POST(HttpRequest.BodyPublishers.ofString(requestXml))\n                .build();\n\n        HttpResponse<String> response = httpClient.send(httpRequest, HttpResponse.BodyHandlers.ofString());\n        int statusCode = response.statusCode();\n        String body = response.body();\n\n        if (statusCode >= 200 && statusCode < 300) {\n            GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper.GetClientLinksResponse successResponse = successMapper.unformat(body);\n            return new OverviewRefreshLinksResult(statusCode, successResponse, null);\n        } else {\n            StandardErrorRSFmtMapper.ErrorReply errorReply = null;\n            try {\n                errorReply = errorMapper.unformat(body);\n            } catch (Exception ignored) {}\n            return new OverviewRefreshLinksResult(statusCode, null, errorReply);\n        }\n    }\n\n    private String escapeXml(String value) {\n        if (value == null) return \"\";\n        return value.replace(\"&\", \"&amp;\")\n                .replace(\"<\", \"&lt;\")\n                .replace(\">\", \"&gt;\")\n                .replace(\"\\\"\", \"&quot;\")\n                .replace(\"'\", \"&apos;\");\n    }\n}"}, {"path": "src/main/java/com/company/generated/units/u866cbe0670f1/OverviewRefreshLinksResult.java", "content": "package com.company.generated.units.u866cbe0670f1;\n\nimport com.company.generated.units.u5dfecf09ff9f.GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper;\nimport com.company.generated.units.u66bf2c108225.StandardErrorRSFmtMapper;\n\npublic record OverviewRefreshLinksResult(int returnCode, GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper.GetClientLinksResponse successResponse, StandardErrorRSFmtMapper.ErrorReply errorReply) {\n    public boolean isSuccess() {\n        return returnCode >= 200 && returnCode < 300;\n    }\n\n    public String nextTransition() {\n        return \"end\";\n    }\n}"}, {"path": "src/test/java/com/company/generated/units/u866cbe0670f1/OverviewRefreshLinksStepTest.java", "content": "package com.company.generated.units.u866cbe0670f1;\n\nimport com.company.generated.units.u561a01497abb.GetClientLinksRequest;\nimport com.company.generated.units.u5dfecf09ff9f.GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper;\nimport com.company.generated.units.u66bf2c108225.StandardErrorRSFmtMapper;\nimport org.junit.jupiter.api.Test;\nimport java.net.http.HttpClient;\nimport java.net.http.HttpResponse;\nimport java.util.List;\nimport static org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions.*;\nimport static org.mockito.ArgumentMatchers.any;\nimport static org.mockito.Mockito.*;\n\npublic class OverviewRefreshLinksStepTest {\n\n    @Test\n    public void testSuccessfulExecution() throws Exception {\n        HttpClient httpClient = mock(HttpClient.class);\n        HttpResponse<String> httpResponse = mock(HttpResponse.class);\n        GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper successMapper = mock(GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper.class);\n        StandardErrorRSFmtMapper errorMapper = mock(StandardErrorRSFmtMapper.class);\n\n        when(httpResponse.statusCode()).thenReturn(200);\n        when(httpResponse.body()).thenReturn(\"<GetClientLinksResponse><ClientId>123</ClientId><Links></Links></GetClientLinksResponse>\");\n        when(httpClient.send(any(), any())).thenReturn(httpResponse);\n\n        GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper.GetClientLinksResponse expectedResponse = new GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper.GetClientLinksResponse(\"123\", List.of());\n        when(successMapper.unformat(any())).thenReturn(expectedResponse);\n\n        OverviewRefreshLinksStep step = new OverviewRefreshLinksStep(\"http://localhost:8080\", httpClient, successMapper, errorMapper);\n        GetClientLinksRequest request = new GetClientLinksRequest(\"123\", \"0001\");\n\n        OverviewRefreshLinksResult result = step.execute(request);\n\n        assertTrue(result.isSuccess());\n        assertEquals(200, result.returnCode());\n        assertEquals(expectedResponse, result.successResponse());\n        assertEquals(\"end\", result.nextTransition());\n        verify(httpClient).send(any(), any());\n    }\n\n    @Test\n    public void testErrorResponse() throws Exception {\n        HttpClient httpClient = mock(HttpClient.class);\n        HttpResponse<String> httpResponse = mock(HttpResponse.class);\n        GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper successMapper = mock(GetClientLinksRSFmtMapper.class);\n        StandardErrorRSFmtMapper errorMapper = mock(StandardErrorRSFmtMapper.class);\n\n        when(httpResponse.statusCode()).thenReturn(400);\n        when(httpResponse.body()).thenReturn(\"<ErrorReply><ErrorCategory>ERR</ErrorCategory></ErrorReply>\");\n        when(httpClient.send(any(), any())).thenReturn(httpResponse);\n\n        StandardErrorRSFmtMapper.ErrorReply expectedError = new StandardErrorRSFmtMapper.ErrorReply(\"ERR\", \"100\", \"Desc\", \"req-1\");\n        when(errorMapper.unformat(any())).thenReturn(expectedError);\n\n        OverviewRefreshLinksStep step = new OverviewRefreshLinksStep(\"http://localhost:8080\", httpClient, successMapper, errorMapper);\n        GetClientLinksRequest request = new GetClientLinksRequest(\"123\", \"0001\");\n\n        OverviewRefreshLinksResult result = step.execute(request);\n\n        assertFalse(result.isSuccess());\n        assertEquals(400, result.returnCode());\n        assertEquals(expectedError, result.errorReply());\n        assertEquals(\"end\", result.nextTransition());\n    }\n}"}], "dependencies": [{"group_id": "com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat", "artifact_id": "jackson-dataformat-xml", "version": "2.17.2", "scope": "compile", "reason": "XML binding support", "required_classes": ["com.fasterxml.jackson.dataformat.xml.XmlMapper"]}, {"group_id": "org.junit.jupiter", "artifact_id": "junit-jupiter", "version": "5.10.0", "scope": "test", "reason": "JUnit Jupiter tests and execution engine", "required_classes": ["org.junit.jupiter.api.Test", "org.junit.jupiter.api.Assertions"]}, {"group_id": "org.mockito", "artifact_id": "mockito-core", "version": "5.23.0", "scope": "test", "reason": "Mockito mocking framework", "r